// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Heroes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2987940051" "Crey computer records"
// DetailString :
"P1261971399" "These partially corrupted files indicate that Crey has a division that actively seeks out and captures heroes. The files you have focus on a particular target that has eluded them for some time. This hero has been designated with the code name Generation Zero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Woodsman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1324226354" "Scout's final words"
// DetailString :
"P3188093378" "I...thank you. I have dreamed of this for many years, and welcome the peace of death. I must ask you one last favor, a final request. You must find Woodsman. He is trapped somewhere in the city, I know it. I was trying to find him when Nemesis captured me and turned me into this monstrosity. Something...old...took him, took him from the woods long ago. You must find him, this is my last request...do...not...fail..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Shard1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P413306982" "Shard of Kalak"
// DetailString :
"P1978858413" "This powerful mystic device is powered by mystic resonance. Once attuned, it can be used as a location device. How the Shard is used determines it's level of effectiveness. The more resonance that is built up within it, the more chance it will perform the desired task."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Location 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1559971829" "Woodsman's Signal"
// DetailString :
"P4199006551" "The Shard of Kalak resonates, emitting a low sound and a greenish glow. Woodsman must be somewhere in Eden!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Essence 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P2751284559" "The Shard of Kalak draws energy from the air around you. The entire cavern is a vortex of mystical energy for a few moments. The Shard is then glows with vibrant green energy, at the same time brighter and more soothing than before."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Jurassik 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1301891731" "Wall scrawling"
// DetailString :
"P4000789317" "You find this message scratched into the wall of the warehouse: 'Beware Jurassik, the monstrosity will crush us all...'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2838813914" "Numina's Dream"
// DetailString :
"P1852095977" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1482197885" "Generation Zero"
// DetailString :
"P3740422042" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow.<br>br> Still sensing something amiss, Numina locked onto a confluence of energy at a Crey facility. Traveling there you discovered records indicating that Crey had been searching for a hero designated only as 'Generation Zero'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeThreeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2647823171" "Scout's final release"
// DetailString :
"P787825875" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow.<br>br> Still sensing something amiss, Numina locked onto a confluence of energy at a Crey facility. Traveling there you discovered records indicating that Crey had been searching for a hero designated only as 'Generation Zero'.<br><br> At somewhat of a mystical impasse, Numina contacted Manticore who pointed you at a Nemesis facility. There you discovered a true horror. A young hero called Scout had been captured by Nemesis a generation ago and turned into one of their Warhulks. You freed him from a living death and he implored you with his dying breath to seek the Woodsman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeFourClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1823294532" "The Shard of Kalak"
// DetailString :
"P3827045429" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow.<br>br> Still sensing something amiss, Numina locked onto a confluence of energy at a Crey facility. Traveling there you discovered records indicating that Crey had been searching for a hero designated only as 'Generation Zero'.<br><br>At somewhat of a mystical impasse, Numina contacted Manticore who pointed you at a Nemesis facility. There you discovered a true horror. A young hero called Scout had been captured by Nemesis a generation ago and turned into one of their Warhulks. You freed him from a living death and he implored you with his dying breath to seek the Woodsman.<br><br>With a specific target in mind Numina suggested that you speak to MAGI about a locating device of some kind. That lead you to recover the Shard of Kalak from the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeFiveClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P988157092" "Widdershins and deosil"
// DetailString :
"P2603821619" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow.<br>br> Still sensing something amiss, Numina locked onto a confluence of energy at a Crey facility. Traveling there you discovered records indicating that Crey had been searching for a hero designated only as 'Generation Zero'.<br><br>At somewhat of a mystical impasse, Numina contacted Manticore who pointed you at a Nemesis facility. There you discovered a true horror. A young hero called Scout had been captured by Nemesis a generation ago and turned into one of their Warhulks. You freed him from a living death and he implored you with his dying breath to seek the Woodsman.<br><br>With a specific target in mind Numina suggested that you speak to MAGI about a locating device of some kind. That lead you to recover the Shard of Kalak from the Circle of Thorns.<br><br>After attuning the Shard, Numina set you upon an arduous path to try and locate Woodsman. The Shard tested your resolve greatly, but you managed to locate the are where Woodsman was abiding."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL7_Numina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3408122500" "Soul of the Woodsman"
// tDetailString :
"P3949512273" "Numina, the greatest mystical heroine of our city spoke to you of a disturbance she had sensed somewhere in Paragon City. Her protege Infernal suggested a possible location, and there you were able to free the hero Fatespinner from the Freakshow.<br>br> Still sensing something amiss, Numina locked onto a confluence of energy at a Crey facility. Traveling there you discovered records indicating that Crey had been searching for a hero designated only as 'Generation Zero'.<br><br>At somewhat of a mystical impasse, Numina contacted Manticore who pointed you at a Nemesis facility. There you discovered a true horror. A young hero called Scout had been captured by Nemesis a generation ago and turned into one of their Warhulks. You freed him from a living death and he implored you with his dying breath to seek the Woodsman.<br><br>With a specific target in mind Numina suggested that you speak to MAGI about a locating device of some kind. That lead you to recover the Shard of Kalak from the Circle of Thorns.<br><br>After attuning the Shard, Numina set you upon an arduous path to try and locate Woodsman. The Shard tested your resolve greatly, but you managed to locate the are where Woodsman was abiding.<br><br>Following the trail, you ended up in a huge cave network where the Devouring Earth was returning the city back to nature. Within these caverns you encountered Jurassik, a huge legendary beast. Defeating this titan enabled you to gather the essence of Woodsman into the Shard, freeing him from the Devouring Earth's grasp."

